><p><italic>Abbreviations used in this paper:</italic> CNS, central nervous system&#x0003b; r&#x003b2;-N, recombinant mouse &#x003b2;-netrin&#x0003b; RT-PCR, reverse transcriptase&#x02013;PCR.</p></fn></fn-group></back><floats-wrap><table-wrap position="float" id="T1"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Outgrowth from Olfactory Bulb Explants</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr valign="bottom" align="center"><th/><th/><th/><th colspan="5" rowspan="1">Percent of control</th></tr><tr valign="bottom" align="center"><th/><th>No. of experiments</th><th>No. of explants</th><th>Sum neurite length</th><th>Average neurite length</th><th>Neurite area</th><th>Neurites per circumference</th><th>No. of neurites</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr valign="bottom"><td align="left">Control</td><td align="char" char=".">24</td><td align="char" char=".">52</td><td align="char" char=".">100 &#x000b1; 14</td><td align="char" char=".">100 &#x000b1; 4</td><td align="char" char=".">100 &#x000b1; 10</td><td align="char" char=".">100 &#x000b1; 11</td><td align="char" char=".">100 &#x000b1; 11</td></tr><tr valign="top"><td align="left">r&#x003b2;-netrin</td><td align="center"/><td align="center"/><td align="center"/><td align="center"/><td align="center"/><td align="center"/><td align="center"/></tr><tr valign="top" align="char"><td>7 nM</td><td>6</td><td>11</td><td>127 &#x000b1; 31</td><td>109 &#x000b1; 7</td><td>143 &#x000b1; 23</td><td>108 &#x000b1; 28</td><td>131 &#x000b1; 25</td></tr><tr valign="top" align="char"><td>14 nM</td><td>20</td><td>41</td><td>246 &#x000b1; 32</td><td>139 &#x000b1; 11</td><td>160 &#x000b1; 8</td><td>188 &#x000b1; 18</td><td>189 &#x000b1; 17</td></tr><tr valign="top" align="char"><td>28 nM</td><td>10</td><td>16</td><td>368 &#x000b1; 39</td><td>154 &#x000b1; 10</td><td>197 &#x000b1; 25</td><td>265 &#x000b1; 26</td><td>265 &#x000b1; 17</td></tr><tr valign="top" align="char"><td>14 nM + Ab</td><td>6</td><td>12</td><td>108 &#x000b1; 18</td><td>121 &#x0